        "label": "Launch — PSLV-XL",
        "description": "Sriharikota, India, 2008-10-22. Chandrayaan-1 — India's first lunar mission. Carried 11 instruments including NASA's M³ (Moon Mineralogy Mapper) that would later be credited with the first detection of widespread water on the Moon."
